	(text "Power-up order: 0.75 V -> PG -> 1.8 V -> PG -> 3.3 V -> PG -> 1.2 V and 1.8 V (HR).\nForced PWM: EN below VIN - 200 mV (100k up / 200k down = 3.33 V); EN at VIN would select PFM at light load.\nBuck FB reference 0.6 V: Vout = 0.6 x (1 + Rtop/Rbot). AP61102/AP61302 pinout: FB, GND, VIN, SW, EN, PG.\nCore divider top sits on VCC_SENSE_P (FPGA VCCLSENSE ball, remote sense); 100R from +0V75 keeps regulation if open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
